          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The gap argument checks out with its full hypotheses, but the review’s summary drops a necessary condition on the singular direction. I’ve found a counterexample to that shortened version. I’m also separating two conclusions that need different proofs: non-real zeros at every heat time, and a nondegenerate local collision at a specified point."
            ]
          },
